ey_answer": null}, {"n": 7, "text": "P and Q can complete a task in 30 days. Q and R can do the identical task in 24 days, while R and P can complete it in 20 days. They began working together, but after 10 days, Q and R left. How long will it take P to complete the remaining task?", "options": [{"text": "21 days", "added": false}, {"text": "14 days", "added": false}, {"text": "17 days", "added": false}, {"text": "18 days", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 8, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Number System", "sub": "fractions-decimals", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 9, "text": "In a race of 800 m, Ram can beat Shyam by 50 m, and in a race of 600 m, Shyam can beat Ghanshyam by 40 m. By how many metres will Ram beat Ghanshyam in a race of 400m?", "options": [{"text": "80 m", "added": false}, {"text": "50 m", "added": false}, {"text": "40 m", "added": false}, {"text": "100 m", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Speed-Distance", "sub": "basic-tsd", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 10, "text": "A sum of Rs.2,425 when invested at a certain rate of simple interest per annum for 12 years, earns an interest of Rs.5,238 on maturity. What is the rate of simple interest per annum?", "options": [{"text": "16%", "added": false}, {"text": "18%", "added": false}, {"text": "12%", "added": false}, {"text": "14%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simple Interest", "sub": "rate-time-principal", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 11, "text": "A class of 25 students took a science test. 10 students got an average score of 80. The other students got an average score of 60. What is the average score of the whole class?", "options": [{"text": "68", "added": false}, {"text": "5.6", "added": false}, {"text": "70", "added": false}, {"text": "140", "added": false}], "opt